        "id": 21125,
        "name": "WriterRyan",
        "username": "WriterRyan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-16T17:48:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t know if I could ever pick a favorite hero. From collaborating with Christopher on their stories and helping flesh out the universe of the game, I’ve fallen for almost all of the characters. Usually whenever I’ve really enjoyed one, it was because it was the most recent one that I’d helped work on.</p>\n<p>However, if I really had to choose, I’d go with Absolute Zero, Tempest, and Haka. I can’t narrow down further than that though.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:13.948Z",
