      {
        "id": 21126,
        "name": "Gaarus",
        "username": "Gaarus",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/85e7bf/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-16T18:06:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think you all did a great job at making not just one hero better than all the others and making each hero feel unique. I love how different teams work better and different than others too. I think one of the more fun aspects of the game is finding out which heroes work well together.</p>",
