        "id": 21128,
        "name": "SlenderTroll",
        "username": "SlenderTroll",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/slendertroll/{size}/2832_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-17T03:56:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Absolute Zero is by far my favorite hero, both in terms of play style and flavor. Once you get all of his equipment out, he’s basically indestructible. True, there are a few cards in each villain deck that can severely hamper his abilities, but there are plenty of cards in the game that can cancel those or mitigate their effects, either at the time or shortly thereafter. And on top of that, he just looks amazing!</p>",
