        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/citizen_jodie/{size}/2316_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-17T05:57:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;WriterRyan&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"WriterRyan\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I recently had a situation with Absolute Zero where I was doing 15 damage per turn to the villain and healing myself for just as much every round…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If you’re talking about the game I was playing with you, you healed, like, 20-some damage in 1 round once!</p>",
