        "created_at": "2011-08-17T17:04:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After the game I played last night, I may have to switch my favorite hero to Tachyon, who dropped Omnitron from 40 to 1 HP in one turn, allowing him to be finished off by our Police Backup. Novas are always fun.</p>",
