      {
        "id": 21133,
        "name": "Cervie77",
        "username": "Cervie77",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/ac8455/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-28T18:32:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A friend and I played a “Danger Room” scenario (That is, we shuffled the hero avatar cards together and dealt them out into two random teams of five, and chose a location to fight in, then played against each other.) I had Ra, Haka, Fanatic, Tachyon and Wraith, and I found Wraith to be the most enduring member of my team, even though my friend still managed to knock my team out. I did take down three of his team, Legacy, Bunker and Absolute Zero, before I fell.</p>\n<p>So, I would say that Wraith is way up there, surviving several rounds by herself against three heroes.</p>\n<p>But then I played Visionary on a team against Omnitron once and did a really nasty number on him with Wrest the Mind…</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:14.411Z",
