      {
        "id": 21134,
        "name": "GeorgeDubya",
        "username": "GeorgeDubya",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/b487fb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-02T14:33:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ve been loving playing with Wraith and Absolute Zero the most. Legacy can be a lot of fun too, but I can’t decide whether I like being Paul or Pauline more.</p>\n<p>Of my friends I have gotten to play with me, one plays almost exclusively Tachyon, another loves the sheer survivability of Absolute Zero’s healing, and the Tachyon player’s wife loves Ra for his blunt methods (If it moves, burn it).</p>\n<p>Chris, I can’t thank JJ and Sarah enough for saying “Hey, let’s go see our college friend’s booth.” Keep up the great work and you can be sure I’ll be grabbing whatever expansions come out.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
