      {
        "id": 21138,
        "name": "awp832",
        "username": "awp832",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-07T05:05:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Newest Legacy is a favorite here too.   That power was just what was needed for a very well rounded hero,  who still has plenty of party support in her deck.   Now she can rely on her power instead of one-shots for direct damage, leaving her free to use her play for the turn on buffing, while not sacrificing damage ability to do it.</p>",
