      {
        "id": 21141,
        "name": "Citizen Jodie",
        "username": "Citizen_Jodie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/citizen_jodie/{size}/2316_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-12T17:25:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;TheJayMann&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"TheJayMann\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Citizen Jodie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Citizen Jodie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"GeorgeDubya\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/b487fb/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> GeorgeDubya:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’ve been loving playing with Wraith and Absolute Zero the most. Legacy can be a lot of fun too, but I can’t decide whether I like being Paul or Pauline more.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’ve got to say, I’m a big fan of playing Young Legacy.  She’s packs quite a punch with her innate power and I believe that she’s carried the heroes on the games I’ve played with her.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Until I saw your post here, I thought maybe you were locked out because Christopher had changed your name and maybe you didn’t realize it and were trying to log in to your previous name.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Interestingly enough, nothing changed for my login.  I am actually not even able to sign in as “Citizen Jodie”.  I’ve just been busy and only am able to check back on the forums every-once-in-a-while.  Also, I wouldn’t be deterred if, somehow my name got broken on this forum.  I love the game and want to see the community it builds up around itself.</p>",
